{"id":"573b416d39297a97","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-algebra.md","title":"Algebra","display":"df-algebra — Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-algebra","aliases":["58-df-algebra","Algebra"],"display":"df-algebra — Algebra","depends_on":["[[58-df-vector-space]]","[[58-df-field]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-algebra</span><span>Algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-algebra — Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,A,+_A,\\cdot_A\\in V\">\\(k,A,+_A,\\cdot_A\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span> (field predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k\\)</span> (vector-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Commutative}_A,\\mathrm{Unital}_A:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Commutative}_A,\\mathrm{Unital}_A:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{Alg}_S(k,A,+_A,\\cdot_A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k(A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot_A,A\\times A,A)\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;\\bigl((a\\cdot_Ab)\\cdot_Ac=a\\cdot_A(b\\cdot_Ac)\\bigr)\\land\\forall \\alpha\\in k\\;\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;\\Bigl((\\alpha\\odot_Aa)\\cdot_Ab=\\alpha\\odot_A(a\\cdot_Ab)\\land a\\cdot_A(\\alpha\\odot_Ab)=\\alpha\\odot_A(a\\cdot_Ab)\\land(a+_Ab)\\cdot_Ac=a\\cdot_Ac+_Ab\\cdot_Ac\\land a\\cdot_A(b+_Ac)=a\\cdot_Ab+_Aa\\cdot_Ac\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{Alg}_S(k,A,+_A,\\cdot_A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k(A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot_A,A\\times A,A)\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;\\bigl((a\\cdot_Ab)\\cdot_Ac=a\\cdot_A(b\\cdot_Ac)\\bigr)\\land\\forall \\alpha\\in k\\;\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;\\Bigl((\\alpha\\odot_Aa)\\cdot_Ab=\\alpha\\odot_A(a\\cdot_Ab)\\land a\\cdot_A(\\alpha\\odot_Ab)=\\alpha\\odot_A(a\\cdot_Ab)\\land(a+_Ab)\\cdot_Ac=a\\cdot_Ac+_Ab\\cdot_Ac\\land a\\cdot_A(b+_Ac)=a\\cdot_Ab+_Aa\\cdot_Ac\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}commutative} \\vdash \\mathrm{Commutative}_A(\\cdot_A) \\leftrightarrow \\forall a,b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot_Ab=b\\cdot_Aa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}commutative} \\vdash \\mathrm{Commutative}_A(\\cdot_A) \\leftrightarrow \\forall a,b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot_Ab=b\\cdot_Aa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}unital} \\vdash \\mathrm{Unital}_A(\\cdot_A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists e\\in A\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;(e\\cdot_Aa=a\\land a\\cdot_Ae=a)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}unital} \\vdash \\mathrm{Unital}_A(\\cdot_A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists e\\in A\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;(e\\cdot_Aa=a\\land a\\cdot_Ae=a)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An associative <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-algebra is a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-vector space with an associative product linear in both arguments; all four scalar/additive bilinearity laws are explicit above.</li>\n<li>Examples: matrix algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_n(k)\">\\(M_n(k)\\)</span>, group algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k[G]\">\\(k[G]\\)</span>, tensor algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(V)\">\\(T(V)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Lie algebra: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[x,y] = xy - yx\">\\([x,y] = xy - yx\\)</span>, Jacobi identity</li>\n<li>Hopf algebra: with coproduct, counit, antipode</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lang, Algebra</li>\n<li>Dummit and Foote, Abstract Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-vector-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S$ (field predicate, see [[58-df-field]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k$ (vector-space predicate, see [[58-df-vector-space]])","embed":fal